  "toneGuideTitle": "Guide to Thai tones",
  "toneGuideHeading": "About Thai tones",
  "toneGuideIntro": "Thai has five tones, and the same spelling changes meaning depending on the tone. The tone is determined by the class of the consonant letter (high, mid, low), the tone mark, and the syllable type.",
