  "guideOverviewTitle": "What you do in this app",
  "guideOverviewBody1": "Every day, AI creates Thai sentences matched to your vocabulary. When you finish them, you can generate more on the spot.",
  "guideOverviewBody2": "Learn with a sentence → check with a quiz. Repeat that five times and that's one round.",
  "guideOverviewSummaryQuiz": "After you finish five sentences, you move on to the summary quiz. It's drawn from the sentences you've studied so far, and if you're unsure you can use hints or look back at the sentence.",
  "guideOverviewBody3": "The more you get right in the summary quiz, the higher your vocabulary score, and the wider the range of words that appears in your sentences. Sentences you got wrong are asked again, so you don't have to manage the order of what to relearn yourself.",
  "guideRoleSentenceTitle": "Sentences",
  "guideRoleSentenceBody": "Check how Thai words are used from the detail screen. Remembering a word together with the situation it's used in sticks better than the word alone.",
  "guideRoleSoundTitle": "Pronunciation practice",
  "guideRoleSoundBody": "Compare your own intonation with the model to get the knack of pronunciation. In Thai, tone changes meaning.",
  "guideRoleQuizTitle": "Quizzes",
  "guideRoleQuizBody": "There are two kinds of quiz. The check quiz is one question choosing a word's meaning before you go on to the next sentence. After the fifth, you move on to the summary quiz, where you choose the word for the underlined part from the sentences you've studied.",
  "guideRoleScoreTitle": "Vocabulary score",
  "guideRoleScoreBody": "A score representing your vocabulary, calculated from your quiz results.",
  "guideRoleVocabTestTitle": "Vocabulary test",
  "guideRoleVocabTestBody": "A four-choice test that measures your current vocabulary. The result becomes the starting point for your vocabulary score and is reflected in the difficulty of your sentences and quizzes. You can retake it from Settings up to once a month.",
  "guideRoleRankingTitle": "Ranking",
  "guideRoleRankingBody": "Shows your rank when users are lined up by vocabulary score. Your display name is assigned automatically.",
  "guideRoleTopicTitle": "Topics",
  "guideRoleTopicBody": "Try Thai in all sorts of settings — festivals, temple etiquette, BL dramas and more. You get to touch Thai culture along with the language.",
  "guideRoleNotificationTitle": "Daily notifications",
  "guideRoleNotificationBody": "Useful for making Thai study a habit. The day's sentence arrives at the time you set.",
  "guideRolePremiumTitle": "Free and Premium",
  "guideRolePremiumBody": "You can keep up daily study on the free version too. With Premium, the number of sentences, topic choice, and the vocabulary score cap all expand.",
